  title: Mushroom Farming
  description: 'If you can''t tell I''m a big fan of mushrooms. I''m in need for
    some blood mushrooms that only grow when the ground is exposed to blood.

    Hence
    the name.

    If you make demons bleed and go back to the same spot later, you''ll
    find some have grown.'
